\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Judge models used in the study (clean accuracy on 300-item samples). API models accessed via OpenRouter (fixed API snapshots); local models served with vLLM + AWQ INT4 quantization. $^\dagger $\,gemini-3.5-flash achieves perfect ARC accuracy but with 26.3\% format error rate. Tier assignment follows provider capability classification (frontier $>$85\% clean accuracy on both benchmarks, mid-tier 80--85\%, lightweight ${\leq }$80\% or quantized); all six local AWQ INT4 models fall into lightweight, where quantization-induced accuracy reduction conflates genuine capability limitations with quantization damage (\S  \ref {sec:analysis}).}}{7}{table.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:models}{{3}{7}{Judge models used in the study (clean accuracy on 300-item samples). API models accessed via OpenRouter (fixed API snapshots); local models served with vLLM + AWQ INT4 quantization. $^\dagger $\,gemini-3.5-flash achieves perfect ARC accuracy but with 26.3\% format error rate. Tier assignment follows provider capability classification (frontier $>$85\% clean accuracy on both benchmarks, mid-tier 80--85\%, lightweight ${\leq }$80\% or quantized); all six local AWQ INT4 models fall into lightweight, where quantization-induced accuracy reduction conflates genuine capability limitations with quantization damage (\S \ref {sec:analysis})}{table.caption.8}{}}
